The Sony ILCE-7RM5 HNCS Base DCP is a derived interoperability profile. It keeps
the Adobe Standard first-stage camera rendering required by the pipeline and adds
the project's WB-dependent HNCS carrier/HueSatMap data. The standalone original
Adobe Standard DCP is not distributed here.

Raw proprietary Phocus binaries and raw recovered Phocus WB dumps are not
distributed here.

Hasselblad, HNCS, Phocus, Adobe, Lightroom and Sony product names are used only
for technical identification and interoperability. This project is unofficial
and is not affiliated with or endorsed by those companies.
